      "message": "```suggestion\n    private static String getElementFromMetadata(MediaMetadata data, String key) {\n    String val \u003d data.getString(key);\n    if (val !\u003d null) {\n        int byteCount \u003d 0;\n        int endIndex \u003d 0;\n        for (int i \u003d 0; i \u003c val.length(); i++) {\n            int charBytes \u003d String.valueOf(val.charAt(i)).getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8).length;\n            if (byteCount + charBytes \u003e MAX_ELEMENT_LEN - 1) break;\n            byteCount +\u003d charBytes;\n            endIndex++;\n        }\n        val \u003d val.substring(0, endIndex);\n    }\n    return (val !\u003d null) ? val : \"\";\n}\n\n```",
